    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d696">

                <pb facs="1565" n="1549" xml:id="pg1549"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">394.31/12–351: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Belgium</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Millard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-03T19:00:00+01:00">December 3, 1951—7
                            p. m</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>770. Re Deptel 778, Nov 27 and Embtel 755, Nov 30, rptd The Hague 44. FonOff note recd today requesting immediate
                    consultation on withdrawal of US concession on item 1520. Please instruct.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Millard</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
